    "|Brisbane is the capital of Queensland, Australia, along the Brisbane River. It has a subtropical climate, riverside parks and koala sanctuaries." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ブリスベンはオーストラリア・クイーンズランド州の州都で、ブリスベン川沿いにあります。亜熱帯気候、川沿いの公園、コアラ保護区があります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "布里斯班是澳大利亚昆士兰州的首府，沿布里斯班河而建。气候亚热带，有河畔公园和考拉保护区。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "布里斯本是澳洲昆士蘭州的首府,沿布里斯本河而建。擁有亞熱帶氣候、河畔公園與無尾熊保護區。"
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Brisbane ist die Hauptstadt von Queensland, Australien, am Brisbane River. Es hat ein subtropisches Klima, Parks am Fluss und Koala-Schutzgebiete."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Brisbane est la capitale du Queensland, en Australie, le long de la rivière Brisbane. Elle a un climat subtropical, des parcs en bord de rivière et des sanctuaires de koalas."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Brisbane è la capitale del Queensland, in Australia, lungo il fiume Brisbane. Ha un clima subtropicale, parchi lungofiume e santuari dei koala."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Brisbane es la capital de Queensland, Australia, a lo largo del río Brisbane. Tiene clima subtropical, parques ribereños y santuarios de koalas."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Brisbane é a capital de Queensland, na Austrália, ao longo do rio Brisbane. Tem clima subtropical, parques à beira do rio e santuários de coalas."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Brisbane là thủ phủ của bang Queensland, Úc, nằm dọc sông Brisbane. Có khí hậu cận nhiệt đới, công viên ven sông và khu bảo tồn koala."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Brisbane adalah ibu kota Queensland, Australia, di sepanjang Sungai Brisbane. Beriklim subtropis, dengan taman tepi sungai dan suaka koala."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "บริสเบนเป็นเมืองหลวงของรัฐควีนส์แลนด์ ประเทศออสเตรเลีย ตั้งอยู่ริมแม่น้ำบริสเบน มีภูมิอากาศกึ่งเขตร้อน สวนริมแม่น้ำ และสวนโคอาล่า"
          }
        },
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ब्रिस्बेन ऑस्ट्रेलिया के क्वींसलैंड की राजधानी है, जो ब्रिस्बेन नदी के किनारे है। यहाँ उपोष्णकटिबंधीय जलवायु, नदी किनारे के पार्क और कोआला अभयारण्य हैं।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
