    "|Dhaka is the capital of Bangladesh, on the Buriganga River. Old Dhaka’s Mughal-era sites, crowded markets and rickshaw streets give it its character." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ダッカはバングラデシュの首都で、ブリガンガ川沿いにあります。オールドダッカのムガル時代の遺跡、混み合う市場、リキシャの通りが街の個性です。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "达卡是孟加拉国的首都，位于布里甘加河畔。老达卡的莫卧儿时代遗迹、拥挤的市场和人力车街道构成了它的特色。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "達卡是孟加拉的首都,位於布里甘加河畔。舊達卡的蒙兀兒時代遺跡、擁擠的市場與人力車街道構成其特色。"
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dhaka ist die Hauptstadt Bangladeschs am Buriganga-Fluss. Stätten aus der Mogulzeit in Alt-Dhaka, überfüllte Märkte und Rikscha-Straßen geben ihr ihren Charakter."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dacca est la capitale du Bangladesh, sur la rivière Buriganga. Les sites de l'époque moghole du vieux Dacca, ses marchés bondés et ses rues de rickshaws font son caractère."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dacca è la capitale del Bangladesh, sul fiume Buriganga. I siti di epoca Moghul della Vecchia Dacca, i mercati affollati e le strade dei risciò ne danno il carattere."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Daca es la capital de Bangladés, a orillas del río Buriganga. Los sitios de la era mogola de la Vieja Daca, los mercados abarrotados y las calles de rickshaws le dan su carácter."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Daca é a capital de Bangladesh, no rio Buriganga. Os sítios da era mogol da Velha Daca, os mercados lotados e as ruas de riquixás dão-lhe seu caráter."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dhaka là thủ đô của Bangladesh, bên sông Buriganga. Các di tích thời Mughal của Old Dhaka, những khu chợ đông đúc và phố xe xích lô tạo nên nét đặc trưng."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dhaka adalah ibu kota Bangladesh, di Sungai Buriganga. Situs era Mughal di Dhaka Lama, pasar yang ramai, dan jalan-jalan becak memberinya karakter."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ธากาเป็นเมืองหลวงของบังกลาเทศ ตั้งอยู่ริมแม่น้ำ Buriganga สถานที่สมัยโมกุลในธากาเก่า ตลาดที่แออัด และถนนสามล้อทำให้เมืองมีเอกลักษณ์"
          }
        },
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ढाका बांग्लादेश की राजधानी है, जो बुरीगंगा नदी पर है। पुराने ढाका के मुग़ल काल के स्थल, भीड़ भरे बाज़ार और रिक्शा वाली सड़कें इसे उसका चरित्र देती हैं।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
