        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nơi sinh của nhà thơ Jeong Ji-yong ở Okcheon. Ngôi nhà mái tranh nằm bên cạnh bảo tàng văn học dành cho các tác phẩm của ông."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tempat kelahiran penyair Jeong Ji-yong di Okcheon. Rumah beratap jerami berdiri di samping museum sastra yang didedikasikan untuk karyanya."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "บ้านเกิดของกวี Jeong Ji-yong ใน Okcheon บ้านมุงจากตั้งอยู่ข้างพิพิธภัณฑ์วรรณกรรมที่อุทิศให้กับผลงานของเขา"
          }
        },
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ओकछोन में कवि जेओंग जी-योंग का जन्मस्थान। फूस का घर उनके काम को समर्पित साहित्य संग्रहालय के बगल में खड़ा है।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "|The capital of Anhui, China. It has many research institutes and old sites such as Xiaoyaojin, and serves as a base for trips toward Huangshan." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "中国・安徽省の省都。多くの研究機関と逍遥津などの古跡があり、黄山方面への旅の拠点でもあります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "中国安徽的省会。有众多研究机构和逍遥津等古迹，是前往黄山的中转地。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "中國安徽省的省會。擁有許多研究機構與逍遙津等古蹟,也是前往黃山的據點。"
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Hauptstadt von Anhui, China. Sie hat viele Forschungsinstitute und alte Stätten wie Xiaoyaojin und dient als Ausgangspunkt für Reisen Richtung Huangshan."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La capitale de l'Anhui, en Chine. Elle compte de nombreux instituts de recherche et de vieux sites comme Xiaoyaojin, et sert de base pour les excursions vers le Huangshan."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La capitale dell'Anhui, in Cina. Ha molti istituti di ricerca e antichi siti come Xiaoyaojin e funge da base per gite verso Huangshan."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La capital de Anhui, China. Tiene muchos institutos de investigación y sitios antiguos como Xiaoyaojin, y sirve de base para viajes hacia Huangshan."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A capital de Anhui, na China. Tem muitos institutos de pesquisa e sítios antigos como Xiaoyaojin, e serve de base para viagens a Huangshan."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Thủ phủ của tỉnh An Huy, Trung Quốc. Có nhiều viện nghiên cứu và các địa điểm cổ như Tiêu Dao Tân, và là cơ sở cho các chuyến đi đến Hoàng Sơn."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ibu kota Anhui, Tiongkok. Memiliki banyak lembaga penelitian dan situs lama seperti Xiaoyaojin, dan menjadi basis perjalanan menuju Huangshan."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "เมืองหลวงของมณฑลอานฮุยในจีน มีสถาบันวิจัยมากมายและสถานที่เก่าแก่อย่าง Xiaoyaojin และเป็นฐานสำหรับการเดินทางไปทางหวงซาน"
          }
        },
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "चीन के आनहुई की राजधानी। यहाँ कई शोध संस्थान और श्याओयाओजिन जैसे पुराने स्थल हैं, और यह ह्वांगशान की ओर यात्राओं का आधार है।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "|The capital of China, a city with a long history. The Forbidden City, Tiananmen Square and the Great Wall are the top sights." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "長い歴史を持つ中国の首都。故宮、天安門広場、万里の長城が一番の名所です。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "中国的首都，一座历史悠久的城市。故宫、天安门广场和长城是首要景点。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "中國的首都,擁有悠久歷史的城市。紫禁城、天安門廣場與長城是最主要的景點。"
