        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Thủ đô của Trung Quốc, thành phố có lịch sử lâu đời. Tử Cấm Thành, Quảng trường Thiên An Môn và Vạn Lý Trường Thành là những điểm tham quan hàng đầu."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ibu kota Tiongkok, kota dengan sejarah panjang. Kota Terlarang, Lapangan Tiananmen, dan Tembok Besar adalah tempat utamanya."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "เมืองหลวงของจีน เมืองที่มีประวัติศาสตร์ยาวนาน พระราชวังต้องห้าม จัตุรัสเทียนอันเหมิน และกำแพงเมืองจีนเป็นสถานที่ยอดนิยม"
          }
        },
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "चीन की राजधानी, लंबे इतिहास वाला शहर। फ़ॉर्बिडन सिटी, तियानआनमेन चौक और ग्रेट वॉल प्रमुख दर्शनीय स्थल हैं।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "|The capital of Fujian, China, and an old port city. It is known for the historic Three Lanes and Seven Alleys district, hot springs and Fujian cuisine." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "中国・福建省の省都で、古い港町です。歴史ある三坊七巷の地区、温泉、福建料理で知られています。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "中国福建的省会，也是一座古老的港口城市。以历史悠久的三坊七巷街区、温泉和福建菜闻名。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "中國福建省的省會,也是古老的港口城市。以歷史悠久的三坊七巷街區、溫泉與閩菜聞名。"
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Hauptstadt von Fujian, China, und eine alte Hafenstadt. Sie ist für das historische Viertel Drei Gassen und Sieben Alleen, heiße Quellen und die Fujian-Küche bekannt."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La capitale du Fujian, en Chine, et une ancienne ville portuaire. Elle est connue pour le quartier historique des Trois Lanes et Sept Ruelles, ses sources chaudes et la cuisine du Fujian."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La capitale del Fujian, in Cina, e antica città portuale. È nota per lo storico distretto dei Tre Vicoli e Sette Stradine, per le sorgenti termali e per la cucina del Fujian."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La capital de Fujian, China, y una antigua ciudad portuaria. Es conocida por el histórico distrito de las Tres Calles y Siete Callejones, las aguas termales y la cocina de Fujian."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A capital de Fujian, na China, e antiga cidade portuária. É conhecida pelo histórico distrito dos Três Becos e Sete Alamedas, pelas fontes termais e pela culinária de Fujian."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Thủ phủ của tỉnh Phúc Kiến, Trung Quốc, và là một thành phố cảng cổ. Nổi tiếng với khu phố lịch sử Tam Phường Thất Hạng, suối nước nóng và ẩm thực Phúc Kiến."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ibu kota Fujian, Tiongkok, dan kota pelabuhan tua. Dikenal dengan distrik bersejarah Three Lanes and Seven Alleys, pemandian air panas, dan masakan Fujian."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "เมืองหลวงของมณฑลฝูเจี้ยนในจีน และเป็นเมืองท่าเก่าแก่ มีชื่อเสียงเรื่องย่านประวัติศาสตร์ Three Lanes and Seven Alleys บ่อน้ำพุร้อน และอาหารฝูเจี้ยน"
          }
        },
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "चीन के फ़ूजियान की राजधानी और पुराना बंदरगाह शहर। यह ऐतिहासिक थ्री लेन्स एंड सेवन एलीज़ जिले, गर्म झरनों और फ़ूजियान व्यंजनों के लिए जाना जाता है।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "|The capital of Guizhou, China, with cool summers. Minority cultures, nearby waterfalls and mountain scenery are its draws." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "中国・貴州省の省都で、夏は涼しい街です。少数民族の文化、近くの滝、山の景色が魅力です。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "中国贵州的省会，夏季凉爽。少数民族文化、附近的瀑布和山景是其吸引力。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "中國貴州省的省會,夏季涼爽。少數民族文化、附近的瀑布與山景是其吸引力。"
