    "오늘 화랑이의 탐험 기록입니다.\n\n🐾 이동 거리: {0}\n🚩 방문 장소: {1}곳\n🎖️ 활동 종류: {2}종\n\n더 멀리 이동하고 새로운 장소를 방문할수록 탐험 기록이 늘어납니다.|Hwarang's expedition log for today.\n\n🐾 Distance: {0}\n🚩 Places: {1}\n🎖️ Activities: {2}\n\nTravel farther and visit new places to grow your log." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "今日のHwarangの探検ログです。\n\n🐾 距離: {0}\n🚩 場所: {1}\n🎖️ アクティビティ: {2}\n\nもっと遠くへ出かけて新しい場所を訪れ、ログを育てましょう。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hwarang 今天的探险日志。\n\n🐾 距离：{0}\n🚩 地点：{1}\n🎖️ 活动：{2}\n\n走得更远、到访新地点，让你的日志不断成长。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hwarang 今天的探險日誌。\n\n🐾 距離：{0}\n🚩 地點：{1}\n🎖️ 活動：{2}\n\n走得更遠、造訪新地點，讓你的日誌越長越豐富。"
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hwarangs Expeditionslog von heute.\n\n🐾 Strecke: {0}\n🚩 Orte: {1}\n🎖️ Aktivitäten: {2}\n\nLeg größere Strecken zurück und besuche neue Orte, damit dein Log wächst."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Journal d'expédition de Hwarang pour aujourd'hui.\n\n🐾 Distance : {0}\n🚩 Lieux : {1}\n🎖️ Activités : {2}\n\nVoyagez plus loin et visitez de nouveaux lieux pour enrichir votre journal."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il diario di spedizione di Hwarang di oggi.\n\n🐾 Distanza: {0}\n🚩 Luoghi: {1}\n🎖️ Attività: {2}\n\nViaggia più lontano e visita nuovi luoghi per far crescere il tuo diario."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Diario de expedición de Hwarang de hoy.\n\n🐾 Distancia: {0}\n🚩 Lugares: {1}\n🎖️ Actividades: {2}\n\nViaja más lejos y visita lugares nuevos para hacer crecer tu diario."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Diário de expedição de hoje do Hwarang.\n\n🐾 Distância: {0}\n🚩 Lugares: {1}\n🎖️ Atividades: {2}\n\nViaje mais longe e visite novos lugares para aumentar seu diário."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nhật ký thám hiểm hôm nay của Hwarang.\n\n🐾 Quãng đường: {0}\n🚩 Địa điểm: {1}\n🎖️ Hoạt động: {2}\n\nĐi xa hơn và ghé thêm nơi mới để nhật ký lớn dần."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Catatan ekspedisi Hwarang hari ini.\n\n🐾 Jarak: {0}\n🚩 Tempat: {1}\n🎖️ Aktivitas: {2}\n\nPergilah lebih jauh dan kunjungi tempat baru untuk menambah catatan Anda."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "บันทึกการสำรวจของ Hwarang วันนี้\n\n🐾 ระยะทาง: {0}\n🚩 สถานที่: {1}\n🎖️ กิจกรรม: {2}\n\nเดินทางให้ไกลขึ้นและไปสถานที่ใหม่ๆ เพื่อเพิ่มบันทึกของคุณ"
          }
        },
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "आज के लिए Hwarang का अभियान लॉग।\n\n🐾 दूरी: {0}\n🚩 जगहें: {1}\n🎖️ गतिविधियाँ: {2}\n\nअपना लॉग बढ़ाने के लिए और दूर तक घूमें और नई जगहें देखें।"
